"t":1,"loc":null,"text":"Quintus Vibius swears to you when your province falls: a legate of one of your legions. He can command an army for you."},{"t":1,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Gaius Julius Vindex and Titus Arrius."},{"t":2,"loc":"ROM","text":"Nero's exiles come home and get their estates back. Their families remember who did it."},{"t":2,"loc":"AFR","text":"In Africa, Clodius Macer, legate of III Augusta, holds back the grain ships and raises a legion of his own."},{"t":2,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Titus Arrius."},{"t":2,"loc":null,"text":"A trade agreement is made between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Titus Arrius. Merchants cross the lines."},{"t":3,"loc":"ROM","text":"Nero is dead. Abandoned by the Praetorians, he took his own life outside Rome. The Senate rules, for now."},{"t":5,"loc":"SYR","text":"Gaius Antonius, legate of IV Scythica, claims the purple in Syria."},{"t":5,"loc":null,"text":"A trade agreement is made between Gaius Julius Vindex and Titus Arrius. Merchants cross the lines."},{"t":6,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Gaius Julius Vindex and you."},{"t":6,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and you."},{"t":6,"loc":"JUD","text":"Quintus Pomponius, legate of V Macedonica, claims the purple in Judaea."},{"t":6,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":7,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Titus Arrius and you."},{"t":7,"loc":"GIN","text":"On the lower Rhine, Fonteius Capito is said to want the purple for himself."},{"t":7,"loc":"MOE","text":"Decimus Cornelius, legate of III Gallica, claims the purple in Moesia."},{"t":7,"loc":"ROM","text":"The Senate declares Fonteius Capito a public enemy of the Roman people."},{"t":7,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Titus Arrius and Gaius Julius Vindex."},{"t":7,"loc":"SYR","text":"Sohaemus of Emesa sends 3000 men to Gaius Antonius."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"Gaius Dillius swears to you. He can command an army for you."},{"t":8,"loc":"ROM","text":"The Senate declares Gaius Antonius a public enemy of the Roman people."},{"t":8,"loc":"ACO","text":"The Alpine chiefs send 2000 men to Gaius Julius Vindex."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Titus Arrius."},{"t":8,"loc":"MCA","text":"The Mauretanian chiefs send 3000 men to Servius Sulpicius Galba."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"An alliance is agreed between Titus Arrius and Decimus Cornelius."},{"t":9,"loc":null,"text":"Your legions hail you as imperator."},{"t":10,"loc":"BRI","text":"On the Rhine, the legions refuse their oath and hail Aulus Vitellius emperor."},{"t":10,"loc":"ROM","text":"Marcus Salvius Otho, once Nero's friend, buys the Praetorians and claims the throne."},{"t":10,"loc":"SYR","text":"Vologases sends envoys and gifts to Gaius Antonius: friendship, and the caravans of the East."},{"t":10,"loc":"ROM","text":"The Senate recognises Marcus Salvius Otho as emperor."},{"t":11,"loc":null,"text":"A trade agreement is made between Gaius Julius Vindex and you. Merchants cross the lines."},{"t":11,"loc":"MOE","text":"The Roxolani cross the frozen Danube into Moesia."},{"t":11,"loc":"LUG","text":"On the eve of battle, XXII Primigenia goes over to Aulus Vitellius."}],"rel":{"F5|vindex":30,"F5|galba":30,"player|vindex":15,"galba|player":15,"galba|macer":15,"F16|F22":-9,"F5|player":15,"macer|vindex":-3,"F27|F5":15,"F27|macer":-3,"macer|otho":-3},"treaties":[{"id":5,"type":"truce","a":"vindex","b":"player","target":null,"hostages":false,"from":6,"until":12},{"id":6,"type":"truce","a":"galba","b":"player","target":null,"hostages":false,"from":6,"until":12},{"id":7,"type":"truce","a":"galba","b":"macer","target":null,"hostages":false,"from":6,"until":12},{"id":9,"type":"truce","a":"F5","b":"player","target":null,"hostages":false,"from":7,"until":13},{"id":10,"type":"truce","a":"F5","b":"vindex","targe